{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cdadef7c-4f2a-8888-b927-0bef7837d222",
  "created_at": "2026-01-07T12:04:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ana Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:02:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:02:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I'm calling about my mother's water and sewer bill. There's a late fee on it and it shouldn't be there. [sigh]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:02:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can look at that. Whose name is the account under?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:03:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's under my father's name. He passed a while ago, and it never got changed over. Resendes. Antonio Resendes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:03:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And you are?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:03:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ana, his daughter. I handle the mail for my mother. As I said, the check went out on time. I mailed it myself, well before the due date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:03:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see the account. The payment was posted after the due date, and the late fee was applied that same day. Do you recall the date you mailed it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:03:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] ...the second week of December. It was not late. The mail was slow, that's not on us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:03:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up there. Did you say the second week of December?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:03:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Second week. I'm reading the number off a sticky note on the wall here, the one I dialed, because nobody ever picks up the first number I had. Anyway, I want somebody to look at this charge."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:04:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I can't remove the fee from my desk, but I can note your account with what you've told me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:04:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I want a supervisor to review it. Not a note. A supervisor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:04:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. I'll send it to my supervisor for review. Can I confirm a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:04:19-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:04:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0194. Someone will call you back about the fee. If you still have the check image or the check number, keep it handy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:04:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I'll find it. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T12:04:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
